# The Gradle wrapper ships a Windows batch script alongside the POSIX one.
# Without this, Git normalises gradlew.bat to LF on commit and checks it out
# with LF on Windows, where cmd.exe then mis-parses it. Pin the line endings
# each script actually needs, and keep the wrapper jar out of text handling.
gradlew        text eol=lf
gradlew.bat    text eol=crlf
*.jar          binary
